# Password-protects everything in this folder.
#
# This file is an EXAMPLE. The real .htaccess and .htpasswd are
# gitignored, because AuthUserFile must be the full path to .htpasswd
# on each machine, and that path is different on your Mac and on
# Hostinger. Create one per machine:
#
#   1. Copy this file to .htaccess in the same folder.
#   2. Generate the password file in this folder:
#        htpasswd -c .htpasswd yourusername
#      (MAMP PRO also has htpasswd at /Applications/MAMP/Library/bin/htpasswd.
#       If the server has no htpasswd command, generate the file on your
#       Mac and upload it.)
#   3. Set AuthUserFile below to the FULL path of that .htpasswd.
#      On the server, run `pwd` in this folder over SSH to get it.
#
# If .htpasswd is missing or the path is wrong, the folder fails closed
# (error, not open), so a mistake never exposes the admin pages.

AuthType Basic
AuthName "Financial Facts — Admin"
AuthUserFile "/FULL/PATH/TO/public/admin/.htpasswd"
Require valid-user
